Subject: net: wire up the al_eth 1G RGMII driver

Tree: /mnt/2tb/unvr-port-refs/u-boot-v2026.07 (UBOOT_TREE)
Issue: #224

drivers/net/al_eth/ is copied in from uboot-port/ by
scripts/uboot-build.py; this is the obj line + sourced Kconfig that make it
reachable.

Was: NET_MK_LINE / NET_KC_LINE txt.replace() in scripts/uboot-build.py.

diff --git a/drivers/net/Kconfig b/drivers/net/Kconfig
index 66661868..f30c8038 100644
--- a/drivers/net/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/net/Kconfig
@@ -1108,6 +1108,8 @@ source "drivers/net/phy/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/net/pfe_eth/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/net/fsl-mc/Kconfig"
 
+source "drivers/net/al_eth/Kconfig"
+
 endif # NETDEVICES
 
 endmenu
diff --git a/drivers/net/Makefile b/drivers/net/Makefile
index 5e90183d..e8702abc 100644
--- a/drivers/net/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/net/Makefile
@@ -113,3 +113,4 @@ obj-y += mscc_eswitch/
 obj-y += phy/
 obj-y += qe/
 obj-y += ti/
+obj-$(CONFIG_AL_ETH) += al_eth/
